---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "..//components/Nav.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VWindow from "../components/VWindow.astro";

const vMedia = {
  media: [
    {
      type: "video/mp4",
      src: "https://storage.fictiveflame.co/retro.mp4",
    },
  ],
};
---

<Layout title="Our Process">
  <Nav />
  <SectionHeader>
    <Container classes={["px-6", "lg:px-0"]}>
      <h1 class="text-4xl text-gray-800 font-bold mb-8 lg:text-8xl">
        Our Process
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased lg:text-2xl lg:max-w-4xl"
      >
        What we do here at Fictive Flame is pretty special. We're one half
        engineering firm, the other half film and design. See what happens when
        art and science mix.
      </p>
    </Container>
  </SectionHeader>
  <Container
    classes={[
      "px-6",
      "mt-16",
      "lg:px-0",
      "text-gray-800",
      "grid",
      "grid-cols-1",
      "lg:grid-cols-12",
      "lg:gap-12",
    ]}
  >
    <div
      class="grid-span-1 order-1 sm:mt-8 lg lg:col-span-8 lg:flex lg:items-center"
    >
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-medium mb-8">1. Discourse and Discovery</h3>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased lg:text-2xl">
          Whether you're launching a new product, looking for a deep-dive
          explainer, or kicking off a long documentary project, the journey all
          begins with where you are.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased mt-8 lg:text-2xl"
        >
          Maybe you need more than a video. That's okay, we're a full
          interactive design firm. Either way, we're working to understand your
          goals, concerns, and passions before proposing any creative direction.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-1 order-2 sm:my-8 lg:col-span-4">
      <VWindow data={vMedia} rounded />
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-1 order-4 lg:order-3 sm:my-8 lg:col-span-4">
      <VWindow data={vMedia} rounded />
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid-span-1 order-3 lg:order-4 sm:mt-8 lg:col-span-8 lg:flex lg:items-center"
    >
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-medium mb-8">
          2. Pre-Production and Strategic Planning
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased lg:text-2xl">
          Using your story as fuel, we'll create a marketing and production plan
          that outlines the project goals and defines a clear roadmap to
          success.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased mt-8 lg:text-2xl"
        >
          If this is your first time using interactive or video marketing, don't
          worry. You have an internationally-experienced group of video
          creators, engineers, and data analysts to help crunch all the numbers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="grid-span-1 order-5 sm:mt-8 lg:col-span-8 lg:flex lg:items-center"
    >
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-4xl font-medium mb-8">3. Launch Day</h3>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased lg:text-2xl">
          Whether it's a one-day or one-year engagement, we've got experience
          running projects of all sizes. Our digital production team will ensure
          you have all of the assets you need, from live streams though to
          videos for your social channels.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-light antialiased mt-8 lg:text-2xl"
        >
          We handle music clearance and deliver the finished project to you, or
          we can handle hosting and distribution. It's really up to you and your
          needs, because after all, we're here to keep your creative spark
          alight.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-1 order-last sm:my-8 lg:col-span-4">
      <VWindow data={vMedia} rounded />
    </div>
  </Container>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
